Haey Rul Gaei Mehndi, Haey Rul Gaei Mehndi</p>

<p>Raitaanch Dul Gaei, Mityaanch Rul Gaei, Maa Nu Rawavay, Qasim Di Mehndi.<br />
Kubra Da Baba Chadar Vicha Kay, Chun Chun Kay Pavay, Qasim Di Mehndi.</p>

<p>Maqtal Cho Syed Ey Vain Paaya, Kallah Hay Nana Zahra Da Jayaa,<br />
Kausar Kanaaray Mairay Turgay Saray, Kayra Uthavay Qasim Di Mehndi.</p>

<p>Kuj Mehndi Gohray Summach Lay Gay, Kuj Eyday Tukray Maqtalch Ray Gay,<br />
Syed Musafir Qasim Di Maa Ton, Keewain Lukaa Vay Qasim Di Mehndi.</p>

<p>Putraan Nu Lokon Sehraych Laa O, Qasim Di Pehlaa Majalis Kara O,<br />
Banray Nu Aakho Shagnaa Day Vailay, O Kad Nah Javay Qasim Di Mehndi.</p>

<p>Khaiyyam Andar Jadon Mehndi Aayi, Banray Di Maa Nay Sir Khaak Paayi,<br />
Banree Da Baba Bheni Bulaakay, Ro Ro Vakhaa Vay Qasim Di Mehndi.</p>

<p>Pehra Laga Tha Darya Pe Har Jaa, Pyasa Tha Kunbaa Pani Nhi Tha,<br />
Pani Ke Badlay Ashkon Se Goondhi, Madar Ne Haey Qasim Di Mehndi.</p>

<p>Tukray Huway Yu Armaan Dil Ke, Ankhon Se Uski Kyun Khoon Na Barsay,<br />
Sajjad Aaey Hain Shaam Logon, Dil Mein Basaey Qasim Ki Mehndi.</p>

<p>Farwa Ke Aansu Deinge Zamanat, Poori Na Hogi Kis Trha Mannat,<br />
Kubra Ke Sadqay Jab Koi Beti, Jab Bhi Uthaey Qasim Ki Mehndi.</p>

<p>Tauqeer O Dy Toh Sain Raazi, Mazloom-e-Karbal Di Bhain Raazi<br />
Qasim Di Turbat Dil Vich Waasa Kay, Jeyra Uthavay Qasim Di Mehndi.</p>

<p>Haey Rul Gaei Mehndi, Haey Rul Gaei Mehndi<br />
